ade\" are at the eight cubes 8, 27, 64, ..., 729)","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AAtmosphere_model.png"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7f/Openstax_Astronomy_EM_spectrum_and_atmosphere.jpg/500px-Openstax_Astronomy_EM_spectrum_and_atmosphere.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7f/Openstax_Astronomy_EM_spectrum_and_atmosphere.jpg/500px-Openstax_Astronomy_EM_spectrum_and_atmosphere.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Rough plot of Earth's atmospheric transmittance (or opacity) to various wavelengths of electromagnetic radiation, including visible light","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AOpenstax_Astronomy_EM_spectrum_and_atmosphere.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d3/SB_DouglasPreserve_SunAtmosphericEffects_2017_3_cropped.jpg/500px-SB_DouglasPreserve_SunAtmosphericEffects_2017_3_cropped.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d3/SB_DouglasPreserve_SunAtmosphericEffects_2017_3_cropped.jpg/1280px-SB_DouglasPreserve_SunAtmosphericEffects_2017_3_cropped.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d3/SB_DouglasPreserve_SunAtmosphericEffects_2017_3_cropped.jpg/500px-SB_DouglasPreserve_SunAtmosphericEffects_2017_3_cropped.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Distortive effect of atmospheric refraction upon the shape of the sun at the horizon","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ASB_DouglasPreserve_SunAtmosphericEffects_2017_3_cropped.jpg"}],"sounds":{"air":[{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/19/En-uk-air.ogg?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm